OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police has been
OL,7,Faccused of failing in its legal duty
OL,8,Fto victims of human trafficking at the
OL,9,Fhands of billionaire Harrods owner
OL,10,FMohamed Al Fayed.
OL,12,FIt comes after at least five survivors
OL,13,Fwere confirmed by the Home Office as
OL,14,Fvictims of modern slavery.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FThese survivors have received positive
OL,7,Fconclusive grounds decisions from the
OL,8,FNational Referral Mechanism (NRM), the
OL,9,FUK's official framework for
OL,10,Fidentifying victims of modern slavery,
OL,11,Fincluding human trafficking, forced
OL,12,Flabour and servitude.
OL,14,FThe reporting framework allows victims
OL,15,Fto receive the right support and
OL,16,Fprovides the Government with vital
OL,17,Fdata about modern slavery in the UK.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FStatutory first responders, including
OL,7,Fthe police, Border Force, the National
OL,8,FCrime Agency and local authorities,
OL,9,Fmust refer to the NRM all children and
OL,10,Fconsenting adults they have reasonable
OL,11,Fgrounds to believe may be a victim of
OL,12,Fmodern slavery.
OL,14,FThey also have a duty to notify the
OL,15,FHome Office of these cases anonymously
OL,16,Fwhere an adult does not consent to
OL,17,Fbeing referred.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FCertain non-governmental organisations
OL,7,F(NGOs) like the Salvation Army,
OL,8,FBarnardo's, the Refugee Council and
OL,9,Fthe anti-slavery charity Unseen are
OL,10,Falso able to make referrals as non-
OL,11,Fstatutory first responders, but are
OL,12,Fnot under the same legal duties.
OL,14,FFour survivors, who have all been
OL,15,Fconfirmed as victims of modern
OL,16,Fslavery, told the Press Association
OL,17,Fthe Met failed in their legal duty to
OL,18,Foffer them a referral to the NRM when
OL,19,Fthey came forward.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FInstead, they made self-initiated
OL,7,Freferrals through the NGO Unseen.
OL,9,FThe survivors believe the Met did not
OL,10,Foffer referrals to anyone who came
OL,11,Fforward about Al Fayed until April
OL,12,F2026.
OL,14,FIt it understood the Met believes
OL,15,Fthere is no automatic requirement for
OL,16,Fthem to submit a referral for offences
OL,17,Fthat occurred prior to the
OL,18,Fimplementation of the NRM in April
OL,19,F2009 and the Modern Slavery Act 2015,
OL,20,Fbut that referrals can be submitted.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FHowever, the Home Office views the
OL,7,Fhistorical nature of the alleged
OL,8,Fexploitation as irrelevant for
OL,9,Fnotification and referral purposes.
OL,11,FIt is only if these offences were
OL,12,Freported to the police prior to the
OL,13,Faforementioned dates of 2009 and 2015
OL,14,Fthat there is no legal duty to refer.
OL,16,FMore than 400 allegations of sexual
OL,17,Fmisconduct have been made against Al
OL,18,FFayed, dating between 1977 and 2014,
OL,19,Fincluding sexual assault, rape, sexual
OL,20,Fexploitation and human trafficking.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FThe Met are investigating at least 156
OL,7,Fvictims who contacted them directly,
OL,8,Fincluding 21 who came forward before
OL,9,FAl Fayed's death in 2023 at the age of
OL,10,F94.
OL,12,FThe investigation, known as Operation
OL,13,FCornpoppy, was launched in November
OL,14,F2024 and is looking at people who may
OL,15,Fhave facilitated or enabled Al Fayed's
OL,16,Fcrimes
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FSeven people have been questioned
OL,7,Funder caution. This includes four
OL,8,Fwomen in their 40s, 50s, 60s and 80s,
OL,9,Fand three men, one in his 60s, one in
OL,10,Fhis 80s, and one of unknown age.
OL,12,FOn April 29, 2026, it was reported by
OL,13,Fthe BBC that Rachel Louw had received
OL,14,Fa conclusive grounds decision that she
OL,15,Fhad been a victim of modern slavery
OL,16,Fafter reporting abuse suffered at the
OL,17,Fhands of Al Fayed and his brother
OL,18,FSalah.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FMs Louw said she would not have been
OL,7,Fable to go through with the process
OL,8,Fwithout the support she received from
OL,9,Fan advocacy group for survivors of Al
OL,10,FFayed called No One Above, who worked
OL,11,Fwith Unseen to make the referral.
OL,13,FSince then, all four members of No One
OL,14,FAbove have also received positive
OL,15,Fconclusive grounds decisions after
OL,16,Fself-initiating referrals through
OL,17,FUnseen.
OL,19,FMargo, a pseudonym, was a domestic
OL,20,Fworker for the Al Fayed family after
OL,21,Fthe 2010 sale of Harrods.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
