PN,30810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FShe reported her experience to the
OL,7,Fpolice in 2024 and the Met did not
OL,8,Foffer her a referral to the NRM at the
OL,9,Ftime.
OL,11,FMargo told PA that on the same day the
OL,12,FBBC article about Ms Louw receiving
OL,13,Fher conclusive grounds decision was
OL,14,Fpublished, the Met Police contacted
OL,15,Fher to let her know they believe she
OL,16,F"meets the criteria" to be referred to
OL,17,Fthe NRM and asking for her consent to
OL,18,Fdo so.
OL,20,FHowever, she was already going through
OL,21,Fthe referral process via Unseen.
OL,26,@xD@AOUxD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
