PN,30814
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FElizabeth, also a pseudonym, was a
OL,7,FHarrods employee who was selected for
OL,8,Fabuse off the shop floor.
OL,10,FShe came forward and reported her
OL,11,Fexperience to police when Operation
OL,12,FCornpoppy was launched.
OL,14,FThe Met did not offer her a referral
OL,15,Fto the NRM, but she also self-
OL,16,Finitiated a referral via Unseen and
OL,17,Freceived her positive conclusive
OL,18,Fgrounds decision in May.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30815
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FElizabeth told PA there is a "very
OL,7,Fgood reason" the police are required
OL,8,Fby law to identify victims of human
OL,9,Ftrafficking.
OL,11,FShe said: "It's how we recognise the
OL,12,Fprevalence of this very, very serious
OL,13,Fcrime in the UK.
OL,15,F"To not comply with that duty is a
OL,16,Fvery serious issue."
OL,26,@nD@^OUoD@LO]sD@KOUwD@AOUxD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30816
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FShe said there has been "some
OL,7,Fmiscommunication" from the Met that
OL,8,Ftheir duty to offer a referral does
OL,9,Fnot apply if it is a historical case,
OL,10,Fadding: "That's not true ` it's very
OL,11,Fclear in the law."
OL,13,FElizabeth said: "It's a very simple,
OL,14,Fbut very important thing that the
OL,15,Fpolice are supposed to do, they're
OL,16,Fsupposed to identify victims of
OL,17,Ftrafficking, and they're not doing it."
OL,26,@nD@YOUoD@QO]rD@IOUsD@RO]uD@QOUyD@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30817
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FJustine, also a pseudonym, worked at
OL,7,FHarrods for more than three years in
OL,8,Fthe 90s, and was trafficked during
OL,9,Fthis time.
OL,11,FShe told PA the Met Police did not
OL,12,Foffer her referral to the NRM when she
OL,13,Freported her experience in 2018.
OL,15,FAfter self-referring via Unseen, she
OL,16,Freceived a positive conclusive grounds
OL,17,Fdecision in June.
OL,19,F"The Met had a duty to refer all of us
OL,20,Fthat have been reporting to them about
OL,21,Fthis," Justine said.
OL,26,@{D@AOU}D@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30818
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FThe former head of the Met's own anti-
OL,7,Ftrafficking unit, Phil Brewer, told PA
OL,8,Fhe had never seen any guidance or
OL,9,Fpolicy that backs up the Met's
OL,10,Fposition.
OL,12,FHe said the test for human trafficking
OL,13,Ffor the NRM has three core legal
OL,14,Felements: act (recruitment,
OL,15,Ftransportation etc), means (threat of
OL,16,Fforce, coercion etc) and purpose of
OL,17,Fexploitation (sexual exploitation,
OL,18,Fforced labour etc).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30819
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FMr Brewer said: "There's no caveat of,
OL,7,F'if it happened in the UK, was there
OL,8,Flegislation in place?', which is what
OL,9,Fthe Met's suggesting. That's not
OL,10,Fright."
OL,12,FHe added that regardless of whether it
OL,13,Fwas a legal obligation, the Met should
OL,14,Fhave been referring these victims to
OL,15,Fthe NRM anyway.
OL,17,F"For me, it just seems such a simple
OL,18,Fthing to do that would give the
OL,19,Fsurvivors reassurance that they're
OL,20,Fbeing listened to and believed," he
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,26,@nD@QOUrD@GO]yD@AOU|D@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G19/24
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30820
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786940279
OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FIndependent Anti-Slavery Commissioner
OL,7,FEleanor Lyons told PA: "Victims of
OL,8,Fsexual abuse and human trafficking
OL,9,Fhave endured horrific exploitation at
OL,10,Fthe hands of their abusers.
OL,12,F"The impact can be profound and long
OL,13,Flasting, affecting every aspect of a
OL,14,Fperson's life for years to come. These
OL,15,Fvictims should be offered support at
OL,16,Fany stage in their recovery journey.
OL,26,@oD@XOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G20/24
