OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,F"Statutory first responder
OL,7,Forganisations should refer these
OL,8,Fvictims to the Government's National
OL,9,FReferral Mechanism, which is designed
OL,10,Fto provide care and identify them as
OL,11,Fvictims of modern slavery and
OL,12,Ftrafficking.
OL,14,F"We must do everything in our power to
OL,15,Fprovide protections for victims of
OL,16,Fexploitation and hold the perpetrators
OL,17,Fof this crime to account."
OL,19,FThe Met Police has been contacted for
OL,20,Fcomment.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUyD@ZO]
