OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FAndy Day, the gold commander of
OL,7,FOperation Cornpoppy, said in a letter
OL,8,Fto survivors on August 11: "Work
OL,9,Fcontinues in relation to potential
OL,10,FNational Referral Mechanism referrals.
OL,12,F"The investigation team is progressing
OL,13,Fthis work and will continue to make
OL,14,Fcontact where appropriate. If you
OL,15,Fbelieve this may apply to you and you
OL,16,Fhave not yet heard from the team,
OL,17,Fplease get in touch."
OL,26,@pD@\OUtD@AOUyD@UO]
