OL,3,CMet Police accused of failing in legal
OL,4,Cduty to Al Fayed trafficking victims
OL,6,FA Met Police spokesperson said in
OL,7,FJune: "Specialist detectives continue
OL,8,Fto lead one of the Met's largest and
OL,9,Fmost complex investigations.
OL,11,F"Four suspects have been interviewed
OL,12,Funder caution so far in our
OL,13,Fdetermination to bring anyone who is
OL,14,Fsuspected to have played a part in
OL,15,FMohamed Al Fayed's offending to
OL,16,Fjustice.
OL,18,F"To date, 156 victims have come
OL,19,Fforward and reported allegations of
OL,20,Fsexual assault, rape, sexual
OL,21,Fexploitation and human trafficking.
OL,26,@oD@GOUsD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G23/24
